<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#b73337">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
    <title>Em Manutenção - AWA Motos</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        html, body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a 0%, #2a2a2a 100%);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .card {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 64px 48px;
            max-width: 560px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #b73337;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }
        .icon {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            margin: 0 auto 32px;
            background: rgba(183, 51, 55, 0.15);
            border: 2px solid #b73337;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .icon svg { width: 40px; height: 40px; stroke: #b73337; }
        h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }
        p {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        .info {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
        }
        .status {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
        }
        .status::before {
            content: "";
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            background: #b73337;
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 0.3; }
        }
        .contact {
            margin-top: 24px;
            padding-top: 24px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            font-size: 13px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
        }
        .contact a {
            color: #b73337;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 8px;
        }
        .contact a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
    <div class="logo">AWA MOTOS</div>
    <div class="icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
            <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline>
        </svg>
    </div>
    <h1>Estamos em manutenção</h1>
    <p>Estamos trabalhando para melhorar sua experiência. Voltaremos em breve!</p>
    <div class="info">
        <div class="status">Atualizando o sistema</div>
    </div>
    <div class="contact">
        Precisa de ajuda urgente?<br>
        <a href="https://wa.me/5511999999999">📱 WhatsApp</a>
        <a href="mailto:awamotos@awamotos.com.br">📧 E-mail</a>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
